#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:309
msgid ""
"AIBrix ModelAdapter includes several advanced reliability features to "
"ensure robust LoRA adapter deployments in production environments:"
msgstr "AIBrix ModelAdapter 包含若干高级可靠性特性，以确保生产环境中 LoRA adapter 部署稳健："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:312
msgid "Automatic Retry Mechanism"
msgstr "自动重试机制"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:314
msgid "The controller retries a failed load on the same pod:"
msgstr "控制器会在同一个 Pod 上重试失败的加载："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:316
msgid "The first attempt runs immediately. There is no wait before it."
msgstr "第一次立即执行，之前没有等待。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:317
msgid ""
"After a failure the waits are 10s, 20s, 40s, 80s and 160s, then 5 "
"minutes. The base interval is 5 seconds and the wait doubles, capped at 5"
" minutes."
msgstr "失败之后的等待依次为 10 秒、20 秒、40 秒、80 秒、160 秒，然后是 5 分钟。基础间隔为 5 秒，等待时间翻倍，上限为 5 分钟。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:318
msgid ""
"The retry count stored on the adapter stops growing at 6 "
"(``MaxLoadingRetries``). Loading continues at the capped wait."
msgstr "适配器上记录的重试次数在 6（``MaxLoadingRetries``）处停止增长。加载会按封顶后的等待继续。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:319
msgid ""
"Retriable errors are the connection and gateway errors listed above. "
"Other errors fail that pod immediately."
msgstr "可重试错误是上面列出的连接和网关错误。其他错误会立即使该 Pod 失败。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:329
msgid "Pod Switching and Failover"
msgstr "Pod 切换与故障转移"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:331
msgid ""
"When a load fails, or the pod is still waiting out its backoff, the same "
"reconcile tries the next candidate. Pods named in "
"``adapter.model.aibrix.ai/scheduled-pods`` are tried first. The search "
"stops once ``desiredReplicas`` pods have loaded the adapter."
msgstr ""
"加载失败，或 Pod 仍在等待退避结束时，同一次调谐会尝试下一个候选。``adapter.model.aibrix.ai/scheduled-"
"pods`` 中列出的 Pod 优先尝试。一旦已有 ``desiredReplicas`` 个 Pod 加载了该适配器，搜索即停止。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:333
msgid ""
"Pod choice for ``replicas: 1`` uses one scheduler for the whole "
"controller, set by ``--model-adapter-scheduler-policy`` (default "
"``leastAdapters``). The other policies are ``random``, ``binPack``, "
"``leastLatency`` and ``leastThroughput``. ``spec.schedulerName`` is not "
"read. The CRD defaults that field to ``default``, and the samples still "
"set it."
msgstr ""
"``replicas: 1`` 时的 Pod 选择使用控制器进程级的一个调度器，由 ``--model-adapter-scheduler-"
"policy`` 指定（默认 ``leastAdapters``）。其他策略为 "
"``random``、``binPack``、``leastLatency`` 和 ``leastThroughput``。控制器不读取 "
"``spec.schedulerName``。CRD 将该字段默认为 ``default``，示例清单仍会设置它。"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:336
msgid "Pod Health Validation"
msgstr "Pod 健康校验"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:338
msgid "The controller implements comprehensive pod health checks:"
msgstr "controller 实现了全面的 Pod 健康检查："

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:340
msgid "**Readiness validation**: Pods must be in Ready state before selection"
msgstr "**就绪校验** ：选择前 Pod 必须处于 Ready 状态"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:341
msgid ""
"**Stability requirements**: Pods must be stable (ready for 5+ seconds) to"
" avoid flapping"
msgstr "**稳定性要求** ：Pod 必须稳定（就绪 5 秒以上）以避免抖动"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:342
msgid ""
"**Continuous monitoring**: Unhealthy pods are automatically removed from "
"instances list"
msgstr "**持续监控** ：不健康的 Pod 会自动从实例列表中移除"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:343
msgid "**Startup tolerance**: Handles pod startup delays gracefully"
msgstr "**启动容忍** ：优雅处理 Pod 启动延迟"

