msgid "**Best Practices:**"
msgstr "**最佳实践：**"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:941
msgid ""
"**Use Separate Secrets per Storage Type**: Create dedicated secrets for "
"S3, GCS credentials rather than mixing them"
msgstr "**按存储类型使用独立 Secret** ：为 S3、GCS 凭据创建专用 Secret，不要混用"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:942
msgid ""
"**Test Credentials First**: Verify credentials work by manually "
"downloading from storage before creating ModelAdapter"
msgstr "**先测试凭据** ：创建 ModelAdapter 前先手动从存储下载，确认凭据可用"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:943
msgid ""
"**Monitor Runtime Logs**: Watch runtime logs during first deployment to "
"catch credential or connectivity issues early"
msgstr "**监控 Runtime 日志** ：首次部署时查看 runtime 日志，尽早发现凭据或连通性问题"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:944
msgid ""
"**Shared Storage Volume**: Ensure the ``adapter-storage`` volume is "
"properly shared between runtime and engine containers"
msgstr "**共享存储卷** ：确保 ``adapter-storage`` 卷在 runtime 与引擎容器之间正确共享"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:945
msgid ""
"**Artifact Size**: Large artifacts may take time to download; adjust "
"timeout values if needed"
msgstr "**Artifact 大小** ：大 artifact 下载可能较久；必要时调整超时"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:948
msgid "Runtime Metrics"
msgstr "Runtime 指标"

#: ../../source/features/model-serving/lora-dynamic-loading.rst:950
msgid ""
"The runtime's ``/metrics`` endpoint, the ``aibrix:`` metric names, and "
"``METRICS_ENABLE_TRANSFORMATION`` / ``METRICS_RAW_PASSTHROUGH_MODE`` are "
"documented in :doc:`runtime`. The runtime process only starts with "
"``INFERENCE_ENGINE=vllm``. Rule sets for SGLang and TRT-LLM exist in the "
"code and are not selectable today."
msgstr ""
"runtime 的 ``/metrics`` 端点、``aibrix:`` 指标名，以及 "
"``METRICS_ENABLE_TRANSFORMATION`` / ``METRICS_RAW_PASSTHROUGH_MODE`` 见 "
":doc:`runtime`。runtime 进程只能在 ``INFERENCE_ENGINE=vllm`` 时启动。代码里有 SGLang 和 "
"TRT-LLM 的规则集，但目前无法选用。"

